# Game lokal tidak memerlukan kredensial atau variabel lingkungan.
# Untuk workflow manual, gunakan environment GitHub itch-mbg-evolution:
# Variable ITCH_TARGET = username-itch/slug-game
# Secret BUTLER_API_KEY = kunci API itch.io pribadi (jangan commit nilainya)
# Opsional untuk QA browser lokal:
# PLAYWRIGHT_MODULE = path absolut ke entry module Playwright
# PLAYWRIGHT_EXECUTABLE = path absolut ke executable Chromium
